824 0 obj
<<
  /Type /StructElem
  /S /Figure
  /P 823 0 R
  /Alt (This diagram illustrates the structure of the High Resolution Water and Snow Ice (HR_WSI) Water products portfolio, categorising its components hierarchically. The top-level 'HR_WSI Water products portfolio' branches into two main product groups: 'HR Water Layer (HRWL) 2021' and 'Water Cover Duration (WCD), yearly 2017-2021'. The 'HR Water Layer (HRWL) 2021' group is further divided into: - **Main Products:** - HR Water Layer (HRWL) 2021, 10m resolution, WGS84/UTM Coordinate Reference System (CRS). - Water Presence Index (WPI) 2021, 10m resolution, ETRS89 LAEA CRS. - HR Water Layer (HRWL) Confidence Layer (WCL) 2021, 10m resolution, LAEA CRS. - **Derived Products:** - HR Water Layer (HRWL) 2021, 10m resolution, LAEA CRS. - HR Water Layer (HRWL) 2021, 100m resolution, LAEA CRS. - **Auxiliary Data:** - Rolling Archive (WLRA) 2009-2021, binary water masks, 10m resolution, LAEA CRS. The 'Water Cover Duration (WCD), yearly 2017-2021' group is divided into: - **Main Products:** - Water Cover Duration (WSD), 10m resolution, WGS84/UTM CRS. - **Derived Products:** - Water Cover Duration (WSC), 10m resolution, LAEA CRS. - Water Cover Duration (WCD), 100m resolution, LAEA CRS.)
  /A [<<
    /O /Layout
    /Placement /Block
  >>]
  /K [12]
  /Pg 1549 0 R
>>
endobj

